RPi ALERT base station  \n
  Dashboard and settings:  http://\4/   or   http://\n.local/
  At the command line:     log in, then   rpi-alert status   or   rpi-alert setup
  No network here?         its own Wi-Fi, RPi-ALERT-..., comes up after 3 min: rpi-alert hotspot
  Locked out?              alert_password = ... in rpi-alert.conf on the SD card (docs/access.md)

